  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "沉默是一种处世哲学，用得好时，又是一种艺术。",
      "output_sha256": "7d748c6560eaa82d2f9913e482a0d9e1659417baaa28131ce591e1a45d008f89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "7d748c6560eaa82d2f9913e482a0d9e1659417baaa28131ce591e1a45d008f89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "谁都知道口是用来吃饭的，有人却说是用来接吻的。",
      "output_sha256": "8068940598d44db26dbebcf1714f6e80cbf5c103fd9a80e1fb4154e57c2eeca1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "8068940598d44db26dbebcf1714f6e80cbf5c103fd9a80e1fb4154e57c2eeca1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我认为这两者都没错；不过，如果我们进行统计，嘴巴最常用的功能（或许不是最重要的）应该是说话，我对此深信不疑。",
      "output_sha256": "6c076f911640dcf1e78265a52d42db7f5615c7d73fc036c286893f5f997cbe15",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.41229,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f7f731353783c5d4f27d70c0d6409e1eb8ab31bff5eac8fbaa337e2d5cfdf0d3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6c076f911640dcf1e78265a52d42db7f5615c7d73fc036c286893f5f997cbe15",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如今的流行观点中，说话似乎也算是一种“宣传”，更是自我推广。",
      "output_sha256": "0601001a9d63b0f784d5f8363eed1af66362d9d24bd3cd2ee3a537186f12910b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.530053,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9bd9aa819104ce76db379257fd6fe3e4d271dba4118a702de77861acd04127b4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0601001a9d63b0f784d5f8363eed1af66362d9d24bd3cd2ee3a537186f12910b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以说话彻头彻尾是为自己的事。",
      "output_sha256": "0adeb8697b44aff62d1c9258ffae10b56bb12d2105477d6f633af7edcf9478f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "0adeb8697b44aff62d1c9258ffae10b56bb12d2105477d6f633af7edcf9478f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果有人坚持认为说话是为了别人，凭借一些神圣的名义，我也愿意妥协，允许我这样理解：有时说话确实是间接为自己，而直接则是为他人。",
      "output_sha256": "98e4da7ce8006dd2b209f7aea5f99dc0a5850ac4c8df96bdf04f3065e3f6f96e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.566405,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "73e2cdac5ba493d83be2989d2ff7fcd73c98fbb647702e0b37fff0fa1dd8c389"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "98e4da7ce8006dd2b209f7aea5f99dc0a5850ac4c8df96bdf04f3065e3f6f96e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自己以外有别人，所以要说话；别人也有别人的自己，所以又要少说话或不说话。",
      "output_sha256": "76612609942efe1e2800af7ec1cd83791d2d681f274a04bb6497471d7c9404ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "76612609942efe1e2800af7ec1cd83791d2d681f274a04bb6497471d7c9404ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是乎我们要懂得沉默。",
      "output_sha256": "4bb6b6bbd4b931b1778528cd026322916856dbc487cd9946387f7117220e2930",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "4bb6b6bbd4b931b1778528cd026322916856dbc487cd9946387f7117220e2930",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果你读过鲁迅先生的《祝福》，必然能领会我的意思。",
      "output_sha256": "f3fc64837239ec73fc40ee4547653a2c69a51e89079c20632b20c186ef7e6e2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.605707,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0b89011a395cfb65c50dfee9f201705dcef2fe834929433abfa6e35387ee5a1b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f3fc64837239ec73fc40ee4547653a2c69a51e89079c20632b20c186ef7e6e2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "通常情况下，当我们遇到陌生人时，往往会选择沉默，但也有不少人例外。",
      "output_sha256": "4e0e6f8842d31b93f4263caca3251bb619d53157a2ed0424ec3bd0b7fbf0b210",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.463245,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bcda04a507699fd105e768fa2a96c21c1ed2c57307c9cae80d6ff9ae0c1560f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4e0e6f8842d31b93f4263caca3251bb619d53157a2ed0424ec3bd0b7fbf0b210",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "常在火车轮船里，看见有些人迫不及待似的到处向人问讯，攀谈，无论那是搭客或茶房，我只有羡慕这些人的健康；因为在中国这样旅行中，竟会不感觉一点儿疲倦！",
      "output_sha256": "bf48bf657f7e2e387f8011cedc7c910fc6ae980c60991e98d2e8e9bbb1932eed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "bf48bf657f7e2e387f8011cedc7c910fc6ae980c60991e98d2e8e9bbb1932eed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "见生人的沉默，大约由于原始的恐惧，但是似乎也还有别的。",
      "output_sha256": "b4b0837fb8fb9f3ce84db6257cb7e0254fd31d81ba62b82e27eec6f56614d74f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4b0837fb8fb9f3ce84db6257cb7e0254fd31d81ba62b82e27eec6f56614d74f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假如这个生人的名字，你全然不熟悉，你所能做的工作，自然只是有意或无意的防御像防御一个敌人。",
      "output_sha256": "f549ff130ee9126b235d50f4b5341c50b811217c8b747d3400f13e5e5a7e8ef8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "f549ff130ee9126b235d50f4b5341c50b811217c8b747d3400f13e5e5a7e8ef8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "沉默便是最安全的防御战略。",
      "output_sha256": "a3a1b660862390a70ec7da9b5a5bc0cbcb1c1bba1ab9c03e3323e0a1d003036d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3a1b660862390a70ec7da9b5a5bc0cbcb1c1bba1ab9c03e3323e0a1d003036d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你不一定要他知道你，更不想让他发现你的可笑的地方一个人总有些可笑的地方不是？",
      "output_sha256": "e5264ff5a6daeae24e600f5556c859a9ca61c9a4509be803a725a6f0633c2dc3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "e5264ff5a6daeae24e600f5556c859a9ca61c9a4509be803a725a6f0633c2dc3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你只需让他尽情表达他想说的话，特别是如果他是个健谈的人。",
      "output_sha256": "20ccc07a2c2e4b0c0de84f4128e4d4b9ebabecc8a3d39f7ec6e2fdc5a33f05f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.491527,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e199d70bf5fc1d8995fc627d52c0fc0c28f65001b6026b7f9f5ea5586a425280"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "20ccc07a2c2e4b0c0de84f4128e4d4b9ebabecc8a3d39f7ec6e2fdc5a33f05f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "末了你恭恭敬敬和他分别。",
      "output_sha256": "fe2c66f0a50be312f36eaf258d011800859dbb3a75587e5d1a83018109820cf0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "fe2c66f0a50be312f36eaf258d011800859dbb3a75587e5d1a83018109820cf0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假如这个生人，你愿意和他做朋友，你也还是得沉默。",
      "output_sha256": "9304fa6b98f2ef48f2c08c857348e54bff258989908ca590d60abda67040cb5c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "9304fa6b98f2ef48f2c08c857348e54bff258989908ca590d60abda67040cb5c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是得留心听他的话，选出几处，加以简短的，相当的赞词；至少也得表示相当的同意。",
      "output_sha256": "b1fe48f3c8564085bb3a07150e12f7e46e9d9fd9b88db511e2012cd83c0b101f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1fe48f3c8564085bb3a07150e12f7e46e9d9fd9b88db511e2012cd83c0b101f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这便是知己的开端，或至少是最初的知己。",
      "output_sha256": "4cd6b88c44dd747134fec45fba92d72e38240733343ca3c65593d558a79eac02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.549706,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5a36a520512118030758a2cbca00d9a6319b6ebbed55af18874481af00394e2e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4cd6b88c44dd747134fec45fba92d72e38240733343ca3c65593d558a79eac02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假如这个人是你所敬仰的或未必敬仰的“大人物”，你记住，更不可不沉默！",
      "output_sha256": "227c48245e4f49edf4241b7037d9aa889e265c73e4931a3b5c2bd0fb4382c8bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "227c48245e4f49edf4241b7037d9aa889e265c73e4931a3b5c2bd0fb4382c8bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "大人物的言辞，甚至他们的神情和目光，都有其独特之处；你最好选择远远地坐着，让那些勇敢的同伴上前交谈。",
      "output_sha256": "ae655e4b901f055776ae5dc0f223dd477bafe3dca1f3eebafc84038052830f00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.597619,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0e07f365a08ca69e6d5a5c6558445097013208666e523146c9b33da74f4c5cf4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ae655e4b901f055776ae5dc0f223dd477bafe3dca1f3eebafc84038052830f00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自然，我说的只是你偶然地遇着或随众访问大人物的时候。",
      "output_sha256": "4f5a0e5508ececb12f6e65b2e4ff85e44757b2995eabfb618b3cb37e5cbdd14d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f5a0e5508ececb12f6e65b2e4ff85e44757b2995eabfb618b3cb37e5cbdd14d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果你希望专诚拜见，则另当别论；对我而言，这确实是件可怕的事情。",
      "output_sha256": "7f98ece3efe67a3bef1fd21aa5a923eb5182e13a1b4ddd6c10862e1dbdad9db6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.447345,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "41cbfe7af6ad621a4c3b70692742df21fd23d1bb0b3003d46ed827ceae252b2a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7f98ece3efe67a3bef1fd21aa5a923eb5182e13a1b4ddd6c10862e1dbdad9db6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你看看大人物与非大人物或大人物与大人物间谈话的情形，准可以满足，而不用从牙缝里迸出一个字。",
      "output_sha256": "e0978f81516e170787175e63622b76f5e210bbe46dc040bcf905dc57dc9a3255",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "e0978f81516e170787175e63622b76f5e210bbe46dc040bcf905dc57dc9a3255",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "说话是一件费神的事，能少说或不说以及应少说或不说的时候，沉默实在是长寿之一道。",
      "output_sha256": "38604e753eea9cb56b8662d0012a2f12a5ad34d6a23569660b0f11a1958467c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "38604e753eea9cb56b8662d0012a2f12a5ad34d6a23569660b0f11a1958467c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至于自我宣传，诚哉重要谁能不承认这是重要呢？",
      "output_sha256": "7a08915fc8caaaea52f6c393ae3859a1f81dd1e6af716a8cc80103db2b759a5c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "7a08915fc8caaaea52f6c393ae3859a1f81dd1e6af716a8cc80103db2b759a5c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但面对陌生人，这种宣传是徒劳的；他不会理解你的意图，只会暗自嘲笑你的热情；在与你一鞠躬或握手后，他会将你抛诸脑后。",
      "output_sha256": "98b665b0f5aa6bdf3873baf04e10d2eb9cd96fe2dfd9d42824aecb796c9217cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.512275,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4644a03b2aae1888f4f69b2847d6c61684c82e11f3c9cd2b297ce4dd34b1b1ec"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "98b665b0f5aa6bdf3873baf04e10d2eb9cd96fe2dfd9d42824aecb796c9217cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "朋友和生人不同，就在他们能听也肯听你的说话宣传。",
      "output_sha256": "7c86e488be8d6659201870103953bf77887aca9e52e3353480edfeb40533ffcf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c86e488be8d6659201870103953bf77887aca9e52e3353480edfeb40533ffcf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在这一点上，彼此之间的交流是相互的，虽说是交换，但也无妨。",
      "output_sha256": "f50bc40aceb72d5ba2c9f709093d9073eb8198112c9612bf14c64e0492e06bcd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.337471,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1e6ae7eb28a1441475f4d32a46e82425170032752cc6e8814bd009e71b60e895"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f50bc40aceb72d5ba2c9f709093d9073eb8198112c9612bf14c64e0492e06bcd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们在不同的程度下了解你，谅解你；他们对于你有了相当的趣味和礼貌。",
      "output_sha256": "830f349588f8d93b70e01af6c033f18eb3d5826a38be552b0a1335fde4fb77e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "830f349588f8d93b70e01af6c033f18eb3d5826a38be552b0a1335fde4fb77e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你的话能满足他们的好奇，他们便乐于倾听；而当你的话语严肃或悲伤时，他们出于礼貌，也会暂时与之共鸣。",
      "output_sha256": "ffda03819174c14d3252f7c8e5b1e3714cf04c1d0244e3363fb862e8933e0414",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.512681,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0773f0f564688d779802534472c7300cf858c67661ac47a6215fb769147a07a4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ffda03819174c14d3252f7c8e5b1e3714cf04c1d0244e3363fb862e8933e0414",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在后一种情形里，满足的是你；他们所真感到的怕倒是矜持的气氛。",
      "output_sha256": "9ced63e7852eb4ea5af0953342bdc03a36186be5cc653d54ab9e49c020e08bf3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ced63e7852eb4ea5af0953342bdc03a36186be5cc653d54ab9e49c020e08bf3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们知道“应该”如何行事；这实际上是一种牺牲，值得“感谢”。",
      "output_sha256": "1b2b02f96cec324c10f94850116009696aea9370de33852bf1c54e6fe7281ff9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.636841,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e4952cab3e08e5374d510373ee2022b46ba45d58e610a22f6894197ef1507689"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1b2b02f96cec324c10f94850116009696aea9370de33852bf1c54e6fe7281ff9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是即使在知己的朋友面前，你的话也还不应该说得太多；同样的故事，情感，和警句，隽语，也不宜重复的说。",
      "output_sha256": "98f30a1e6d60bbcf06f27cd13c6142127f5f6af3bd630d438e950cab8c806ac5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "98f30a1e6d60bbcf06f27cd13c6142127f5f6af3bd630d438e950cab8c806ac5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "《祝福》就是一个好榜样。",
      "output_sha256": "50ece582b4f5b987e1c94fc756fccbbdd4245ec0ffec8c4209d4264d7e7edf6c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "50ece582b4f5b987e1c94fc756fccbbdd4245ec0ffec8c4209d4264d7e7edf6c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你应该相当的节制自己，不可妄想你的话占领朋友们整个的心你自己的心，也不会让别人完全占领呀。",
      "output_sha256": "82e04680f5a8dd3ac9328bf7e5a913fbb2e3769313bae9597e50138f0cbc3d02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "82e04680f5a8dd3ac9328bf7e5a913fbb2e3769313bae9597e50138f0cbc3d02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你更应该知道怎样藏匿你自己。",
      "output_sha256": "4ecb83f3f4c1dfc1b9cbbaa1e4b733441ce633430e9f9ff4684eb4dd160fa6ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "4ecb83f3f4c1dfc1b9cbbaa1e4b733441ce633430e9f9ff4684eb4dd160fa6ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "只有那些不可知、不可得的东西，才会引人追求；如果你将一切都给了别人，你对他们、对世界将毫无意义，犹如医学学生在解剖时使用的尸体一样。",
      "output_sha256": "c9991179016c97932b2d88c0382a499172a60a5b221af44eafe4dc215b3212c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.607613,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f0ab55dcc5e9c2875668a3ada5f24b2687618afc30eab768d987f5c3105b6a5d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c9991179016c97932b2d88c0382a499172a60a5b221af44eafe4dc215b3212c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那时是不可思议的孤独，你将不能支持自己，而倾仆到无底的黑暗里去。",
      "output_sha256": "4a836632b22e16f69ff244b30d18be0c48e56b080fa781b55782343d7b6f0bf5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a836632b22e16f69ff244b30d18be0c48e56b080fa781b55782343d7b6f0bf5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一个情人常喜欢说：“我愿意将所有的都献给你！”",
      "output_sha256": "21c00d468994211cdc61a92f24c8a689a676ee90a1995a833d515bc9c2ea2e97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "21c00d468994211cdc61a92f24c8a689a676ee90a1995a833d515bc9c2ea2e97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "谁真知道他或她所有的是些什么呢？",
      "output_sha256": "3f1d7e3ed3645ab50c6ef94ff95edbb32e8dce4d302b8a7aa9cd601b6293ad94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f1d7e3ed3645ab50c6ef94ff95edbb32e8dce4d302b8a7aa9cd601b6293ad94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第一个说这句话的人，只是表示自己的慷慨，至多也只是表示一种理想；以后跟着说的，更只是“口头禅”而已。",
      "output_sha256": "debae6d2cf690a75d00e1f5b165a955b60fe3f8b0bb85577ef848bd7cc022738",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "debae6d2cf690a75d00e1f5b165a955b60fe3f8b0bb85577ef848bd7cc022738",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以朋友间，甚至恋人间，沉默还是不可少的。",
      "output_sha256": "e0d66894858c388a92ec491861692478a9a105e6b05f6b750ce42d59570b69c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "e0d66894858c388a92ec491861692478a9a105e6b05f6b750ce42d59570b69c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你的话应该像黑夜的星星，不应该像除夕的爆竹谁稀罕那彻宵的爆竹呢？",
      "output_sha256": "0f2af9bf8cf022241222ba177fd6d3dd067e92190bfa2e796f09794c3bc5fc77",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "0f2af9bf8cf022241222ba177fd6d3dd067e92190bfa2e796f09794c3bc5fc77",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而沉默有时更具诗意。",
      "output_sha256": "906eb59c1ca27dab26caf8455c6f0c370ab40583c724579bb32623c7dc529a3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.805,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c84bf2e2cce15c7a98975e10d64867f9053223b77d5d0b8c497ef375db56b7fa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "906eb59c1ca27dab26caf8455c6f0c370ab40583c724579bb32623c7dc529a3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "例如在午后、黄昏、深夜、在宽敞宁静的房间里，短暂的沉默或许远胜于连绵不绝的疲惫谈话。",
      "output_sha256": "e5d6135abc6077d787561e6480d540207030d475fe231bdf22f509228884bce8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.553423,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "af80127e5b2fee63c0e6aaa915acfb95557f772e1cbc1114d09b5f53ed61250e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e5d6135abc6077d787561e6480d540207030d475fe231bdf22f509228884bce8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有人称这种境界为“无言之美”，你瞧，多漂亮的名字！",
      "output_sha256": "c885b865464fa69e568e7d86f4892adb8e89fa81a57450db01638bc0b65176bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "c885b865464fa69e568e7d86f4892adb8e89fa81a57450db01638bc0b65176bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至于所谓“拈花微笑”，那更了不起了！",
      "output_sha256": "bc5f2d3f51699acbfda23f2b440289deff43fcd62bc116577b22808ce1bf3330",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "bc5f2d3f51699acbfda23f2b440289deff43fcd62bc116577b22808ce1bf3330",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是沉默也有不行的时候。",
      "output_sha256": "c52e51bc464ad7e9f7839beee6e2b24f7ad9b13b1508857f80cb09143add9510",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "c52e51bc464ad7e9f7839beee6e2b24f7ad9b13b1508857f80cb09143add9510",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在人多时，你容易陷入沉默，但在一对一的交谈中，这种沉默是不被允许的。",
      "output_sha256": "b0b0c36740caf67809ac36855b67513f63c072bc77fd6a294e6544f35e384133",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.398707,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "925143e8baec8f77c7240684bcc7c43afad8ee552dddba793683f5bd68f7995b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b0b0c36740caf67809ac36855b67513f63c072bc77fd6a294e6544f35e384133",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "过于沉默可能会让你的客人感到不快，甚至离开！",
      "output_sha256": "83ff1564d05699951f67bac5cba2118244930a27318cfd10f7490a7aaccce985",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.301878,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "43a1de57426d3f41d53ade79baf15353c317d7c4b57a006130387cf0eff6a7d3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "83ff1564d05699951f67bac5cba2118244930a27318cfd10f7490a7aaccce985",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "倘使你愿意赶他，当然很好；倘使你不愿意呢，你就得不时的让他喝茶，抽烟，看画片，读报，听话匣子，偶然也和他谈谈天气，时局只是复述报纸的记载，加上几个不能解决的疑问，总以引他说话为度。",
      "output_sha256": "c71fb6e2d538b28a4efe235f562466895275ff1db933ef9e3669548208b68a43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "c71fb6e2d538b28a4efe235f562466895275ff1db933ef9e3669548208b68a43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是你点点头，哼哼鼻子，时而叹叹气，听着。",
      "output_sha256": "929e8039022f1d66405858bad049a5f67e214bdce16ce1fa2015f6e485196346",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "929e8039022f1d66405858bad049a5f67e214bdce16ce1fa2015f6e485196346",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他说完了，你再给起个头，照样的听着。",
      "output_sha256": "d7e2db8ff20ec374c4c685c15311120e2dbe9c56c4965a9f738da2ad800a2ee7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7e2db8ff20ec374c4c685c15311120e2dbe9c56c4965a9f738da2ad800a2ee7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是我的朋友遇见过一个生客，他是一位准大人物，因某种礼貌关系去看我的朋友。",
      "output_sha256": "c190e77385b7a01c535b63bccee1581c50cfda6b3fc0238c78712b614f8a91be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "c190e77385b7a01c535b63bccee1581c50cfda6b3fc0238c78712b614f8a91be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他坐下时，将两手笼起，搁在桌上。",
      "output_sha256": "c35a8c85efd264bdb9597d7f8ae6e8a80f4f8252e468bc7789bba89f2f9f3490",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "c35a8c85efd264bdb9597d7f8ae6e8a80f4f8252e468bc7789bba89f2f9f3490",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "说了几句后便停住，两眼炯炯地盯着我的朋友。",
      "output_sha256": "1f799818baa8cd13d75c7cc4fb2532b7260723fbcbe17ed5df0f1b8e29d229ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.665675,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "72906b70f3d24e29ba2fd10bf9d5f095a4831576f9971ce9d938582bafceef99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1f799818baa8cd13d75c7cc4fb2532b7260723fbcbe17ed5df0f1b8e29d229ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的朋友窘极，好容易陆陆续续地找出一句半句话来敷衍。",
      "output_sha256": "955d3cc301ab0dbb30fab3e4e493bea7e4523424bf7451702f78d54741c55ef3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "955d3cc301ab0dbb30fab3e4e493bea7e4523424bf7451702f78d54741c55ef3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这自然也是沉默的一种用法，是上司对属僚保持威严用的。",
      "output_sha256": "6c8eb61d125d7b2fe2cdd7715d50156acbf798988aff9cfd4eb3b2e59d4e1a90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "6c8eb61d125d7b2fe2cdd7715d50156acbf798988aff9cfd4eb3b2e59d4e1a90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
